  "description": "<p>Refactor fixity checks of binaries into separate service(s). There are two implementations of it, one in InternalFedoraBinary and one in UrlBinary. Both of these should be handled by one or more services:</p>\n\n<p><b>FedoraBinary.checkFixity</b></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.1.0/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/UrlBinary.java#L265\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.1.0/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/UrlBinary.java#L265</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.1.0/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/InternalFedoraBinary.java#L268\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.1.0/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/InternalFedoraBinary.java#L268</a></p>\n\n<p>May also need to handle <b>verifyChecksums</b>:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.1.0/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/InternalFedoraBinary.java#L200\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.1.0/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/InternalFedoraBinary.java#L200</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.1.0/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/UrlBinary.java#L186\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-5.1.0/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/UrlBinary.java#L186</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>",
